    m_Key: none (generic AETR guess)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309703
    m_Key: 'Mapping: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309704
    m_Key: your calibration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309705
    m_Key: preset/default. Calibrate for best results
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309706
    m_Key: Connect a radio first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309707
    m_Key: BetaFPV radio (generic)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309708
    m_Key: EdgeTX / OpenTX radio (generic)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309709
    m_Key: BetaFPV LiteRadio 2 SIM (joystick mode)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309710
    m_Key: BetaFPV LiteRadio 2 SIM (Xbox mode)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309711
    m_Key: RadioMaster Pocket (EdgeTX USB joystick)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309712
    m_Key: Calibrate radio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309713
    m_Key: Cancel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309714
    m_Key: Skip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309715
    m_Key: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309716
    m_Key: Step {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309717
    m_Key: 'Move BOTH sticks to every corner a few times. ({0}/4 axes found)

      Don''t touch the switches.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309718
    m_Key: Now let both sticks centre, THROTTLE DOWN, and hold still...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309719
    m_Key: Push THROTTLE fully UP and hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309720
    m_Key: Throttle back down. Push YAW fully RIGHT and hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309721
    m_Key: Centre yaw. Push PITCH fully FORWARD (nose down) and hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309722
    m_Key: Centre pitch. Push ROLL fully RIGHT and hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309723
    m_Key: 'Centre the sticks. Flip your ARM switch to ARMED and hold.

      (Skip if you want to arm with throttle low instead.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309724
    m_Key: 'Put the MODE switch in ACRO, then move it to ANGLE and hold.

      (Skip if you don''t use a mode switch.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309725
    m_Key: 'If the mode switch has a third position, move it to HORIZON and hold.

      (Skips by itself after a few seconds.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309726
    m_Key: 'Optional: flip the switch (or press the button) you want for CAMERA VIEW and hold.

      (Skip if you don''t want one.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309727
    m_Key: Done! Flip the arm switch off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309728
    m_Key: Cancelled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309729
    m_Key: 'Calibration incomplete: not all four stick axes were found. Try again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309730
    m_Key: Calibration saved ({0}). Throttle ch{1}, yaw ch{2}, pitch ch{3}, roll ch{4}{5}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309731
    m_Key: ', arm ch{0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309732
    m_Key: ', arm with throttle low'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309733
    m_Key: ', view ch{0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309734
    m_Key: Connecting a radio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309735
    m_Key: '<b>RadioMaster Pocket / EdgeTX radios (PC):</b> power the radio <b>on</b>, plug in USB and pick <b>USB Joystick (HID)</b>. No driver is needed. If Windows shows "STM32 BOOTLOADER", the radio is in firmware mode: unplug it and power it on normally first. In the model''s mixes, put SA on CH5 (arm) and SB on CH6 (flight mode).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309736
    m_Key: <b>LiteRadio 2 SE / LiteRadio 3 (USB-C):</b> power the radio on in <b>joystick (HID) mode</b> and plug it into the PC. If the sticks don't move in {0}, enable joystick compatibility in <b>BETAFPV Configurator</b>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309737
    m_Key: <b>LiteRadio 2 SIM:</b> joystick mode (default) shows up as "BETAFPV Joystick". In Xbox mode it works as a gamepad; throttle is then full-range, like a radio.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309738
    m_Key: <b>LiteRadio 4 / 4 SE (ELRS):</b> USB-C, or <b>Bluetooth joystick mode</b> paired in <b>Windows Settings > Bluetooth & devices</b>. Over USB-C, joystick mode only works with the radio <b>switched off</b> and powered by the cable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309739
    m_Key: <b>Then:</b> Menu > {0} > <b>{1}</b>. Arm with your arm switch (throttle low). The calibration can also assign a <b>camera view</b> switch. If some sticks or switches don't move in {0}, check {2}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309740
    m_Key: 'Report saved: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309741
    m_Key: No devices
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309742
    m_Key: layout {0}   interface {1}   {2}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309743
    m_Key: product {0}   manufacturer {1}   {2} axes/buttons
    m_Metadata:
