    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196318867462
    m_Key: Right stick to the left (slide left)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196318867463
    m_Key: Right stick to the right (slide right)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061760
    m_Key: Controls check
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061761
    m_Key: The drone stays on the ground with its motors off. Move each stick as the screen asks, all the way and back to the middle. This is how you learn which stick does what.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061762
    m_Key: Steps done
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061763
    m_Key: Do the steps in the order shown at the top of the screen; each one counts only when the one before it is done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061764
    m_Key: Time taken
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061765
    m_Key: You have the moves; now do them without long pauses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061766
    m_Key: Climb or descend to 1 m and hold it for 5 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061767
    m_Key: Climb or descend to 3 m and hold it for 5 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061768
    m_Key: Climb or descend to 5 m and hold it for 5 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061769
    m_Key: Climb or descend to 2 m and hold it for 5 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061770
    m_Key: Height steps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061771
    m_Key: 'Fly to four heights, one after another: 1 m, 3 m, 5 m and 2 m. Hold each for 5 seconds inside its box, without drifting sideways. Then land.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061772
    m_Key: Staying over the pad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061773
    m_Key: 'Only the left stick moves in this exercise: keep your right thumb still.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061774
    m_Key: Take off and hover in the box, 2 m up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061775
    m_Key: Turn a full circle to the right, on the spot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061776
    m_Key: Turn a full circle to the left, on the spot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061777
    m_Key: Pirouette
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061778
    m_Key: Hover in the small box and turn the drone once around to the right, then once around to the left, without leaving the box. Only the left stick turns the drone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061779
    m_Key: Staying in the box while turning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061780
    m_Key: Turn slowly. If the drone slides away, stop turning, bring it back, then go on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061781
    m_Key: Take off and hover in the near box, 2 m up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061782
    m_Key: Fly 15 m forward and stop in the far box for 3 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061783
    m_Key: Fly back and stop in the near box for 3 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061784
    m_Key: Out and back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061785
    m_Key: Fly straight ahead to the far box, 15 m away, and stop inside it. Then fly back, stop in the near box and land. Start slowing down before you reach a box.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061786
    m_Key: Flying a straight line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061787
    m_Key: Push the right stick straight up and down, not at an angle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061788
    m_Key: Fly to corner 1 and stop for 2 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061789
    m_Key: Fly to corner 2 and stop for 2 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061790
    m_Key: Fly to corner 3 and stop for 2 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061791
    m_Key: Fly to corner 4 and stop for 2 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061792
    m_Key: 'Close the square: back to corner 1, stop for 2 seconds'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061793
    m_Key: Square, tail towards you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061794
    m_Key: Fly a square through four boxes and stop in each. Keep the drone facing away from you the whole time, so left is always left. Then come back and land on the pad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061795
    m_Key: Keeping the tail towards you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765196323061796
    m_Key: 'Leave the left stick in the middle from side to side: in this exercise the drone never turns.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039097585664
    m_Key: Fly back, land on the pad and switch the motors off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694528
    m_Key: Fly to corner 1 and stop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694529
    m_Key: Turn the nose towards the next corner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694530
    m_Key: Fly to corner 2 and stop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694531
    m_Key: Fly to corner 3 and stop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694532
    m_Key: Fly to corner 4 and stop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694533
    m_Key: 'Close the square: fly back to corner 1'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694534
    m_Key: Square, nose forward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694535
    m_Key: Fly the square again, but this time turn the drone at every corner so that its nose always points where it is going. When it flies towards you, left and right are swapped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694536
    m_Key: Staying on the line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694537
    m_Key: Look at the next box, not at the drone, and fly straight at it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694538
    m_Key: Fly to the box in front of the pole
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694539
    m_Key: Circle the pole once clockwise, nose on the pole
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694540
    m_Key: Now once the other way, nose still on the pole
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694541
    m_Key: Circle a pole
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694542
    m_Key: 'Fly a circle around the pole, 5 m from it, keeping the nose of the drone pointed at the pole all the way round. Then do it the other way. You need both sticks at the same time: one slides the drone sideways, the other turns it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694543
    m_Key: Keeping the distance from the pole
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694544
    m_Key: If the circle grows, push a little towards the pole; if it shrinks, pull away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694545
    m_Key: Nose on the pole
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694546
    m_Key: Turn with the left stick at the same pace as you slide with the right one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694547
    m_Key: Come through the box between the poles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694550
    m_Key: Figure of eight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694553
    m_Key: Start each circle from the middle box at an easy speed; a fast entry makes a wide circle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694556
    m_Key: Take off and back away into the box; hold it for 15 seconds, nose towards you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694557
    m_Key: Come back over the pad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694558
    m_Key: Land on the pad, nose still towards you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694559
    m_Key: Nose-in hover and landing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694560
    m_Key: The drone faces you. Now its left is your right, and pushing the stick forward brings it towards you. Hover in the box and land without turning it round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694561
    m_Key: Keeping the nose towards you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694562
    m_Key: 'Do not turn the drone to make it easier: small stick moves, and think from the drone''s seat.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694563
    m_Key: Land on pad 1 and switch the motors off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694564
    m_Key: Land on pad 2 and switch the motors off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694565
    m_Key: Land on pad 3 and switch the motors off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694566
    m_Key: Land on pad 4 and switch the motors off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039164694567
    m_Key: Landing circuit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039168888832
    m_Key: Four pads, each smaller than the one before. Land on each in turn and switch the motors off, then take off again for the next. Finish on the pad you started from.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039168888833
    m_Key: Take off and hover over the pad for 10 seconds; hold against the wind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039168888834
    m_Key: Without position hold, in wind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6771039168888835
    m_Key: 'Position hold is switched off: the drone keeps its height but no longer stays where you leave it, and a light wind pushes it sideways. Hover, then fly the square. This is how a drone flies when it loses its satellite fix.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6775319762305024
    m_Key: Circle the left pole clockwise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6775319980408832
    m_Key: Circle the right pole the other way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6775319980408833
    m_Key: 'Fly a figure of eight around the two poles: once round the left pole, through the box in the middle, then round the right pole the other way. Keep the height the same all the way.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6775319980408834
    m_Key: The circle round the left pole
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6775319980408835
    m_Key: The circle round the right pole
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6775319980408836
    m_Key: 'The second circle turns the other way: slow down in the middle box before you change direction.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737641914368
    m_Key: 'Look straight into the bucket: the camera must be in front of its mouth, not to one side.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634624
    m_Key: Page Up and Page Down tilt the camera, Z and X zoom, P takes a photo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634625
    m_Key: Photograph the low bucket from straight in front
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634626
    m_Key: Climb and photograph the high bucket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634627
    m_Key: Fly over the bucket on the ground, tilt the camera straight down and photograph it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634628
    m_Key: 'Position: three buckets'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634629
    m_Key: 'Three buckets: one low, one high, one on the ground with its mouth up. Put the drone where the camera looks straight into each one and take a photo. Page Up and Page Down tilt the camera, Z and X zoom, P takes a photo.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634630
    m_Key: Photos taken
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634631
    m_Key: 'Line the camera up first, then take one photo: a photo that misses the bucket is wasted.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634632
    m_Key: Photograph bucket 1 from straight in front
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634633
    m_Key: Photograph bucket 2 from straight in front
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634634
    m_Key: Photograph bucket 3 from straight in front
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634635
    m_Key: Photograph bucket 4 from straight in front
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634636
    m_Key: 'Traverse: four buckets in a row'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634637
    m_Key: Four buckets stand in a row, all at 2 m. Slide sideways along the row, level and at the same distance, and photograph each one from straight in front. Do not turn the drone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634638
    m_Key: Photograph the bucket facing you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634639
    m_Key: Go on round the stand and photograph the next bucket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634640
    m_Key: 'Orbit: four sides of a stand'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634641
    m_Key: A stand carries four buckets, one facing each way. Circle it clockwise, 5 m out, with the camera on the stand, and photograph each bucket as you come in front of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634642
    m_Key: Keeping the distance from the stand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634643
    m_Key: If the circle grows, push a little towards the stand; if it shrinks, pull away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634644
    m_Key: Camera on the stand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634645
    m_Key: Photograph the bucket at 2 m
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634646
    m_Key: Photograph the bucket at 4 m
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634647
    m_Key: Photograph the bucket at 6 m
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634648
    m_Key: Come down the other side and photograph the last bucket, at 4 m
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634649
    m_Key: 'Spiral: up and down a tower'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634650
    m_Key: The buckets are on a tower, at 2 m, 4 m, 6 m and 4 m, each facing a different way. Climb round the tower to the top and come down the other side, photographing each bucket from in front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634651
    m_Key: Camera on the tower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634652
    m_Key: 'Climb and turn at the same time, a little of each: the tower should stay in the middle of the picture.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634653
    m_Key: Fly over bucket 1, look straight down and photograph it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634654
    m_Key: Fly over bucket 2, look straight down and photograph it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634655
    m_Key: Fly over bucket 3, look straight down and photograph it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634656
    m_Key: 'Recon: look into three buckets'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634657
    m_Key: Three buckets lie on the ground with their mouths up. Fly over each at 3 m or more, tilt the camera straight down, bring the bucket to the middle of the picture and photograph it. Zoom in if you need to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634658
    m_Key: Fly out to the far box and hold it for 3 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634659
    m_Key: 'The battery is low: fly straight back and stop over the pad'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634660
    m_Key: 'A motor is weak: land now, gently, on the pad'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634661
    m_Key: Emergency drills
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634662
    m_Key: 'Things go wrong on this flight. When you reach the far box the battery drops: come straight home. Over the pad a motor weakens: land at once and gently. Read the top of the screen and do not hurry more than you must.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6778737700634663
    m_Key: 'With a weak motor the drone sinks faster: add throttle earlier than usual.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631453392896
    m_Key: Take off and hover in the box for 3 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861888
    m_Key: Fly through gate 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861889
    m_Key: Fly through gate 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861890
    m_Key: Fly through gate 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861891
    m_Key: Land on the far pad and switch the motors off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861892
    m_Key: Hover, then three gates in a line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861893
    m_Key: 'Your first flight through the drone''s own camera. The drone levels itself, but nothing holds its height or its place: that is your job now. Hover in the box, then fly straight through the three gates and land on the far pad.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861894
    m_Key: Time at the right height
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861895
    m_Key: 'The throttle holds the height: tiny moves, and look far ahead, not at the ground under you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861896
    m_Key: 'Lap 1: follow the oval round the two flags'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861897
    m_Key: 'Lap 2: follow the oval round the two flags'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861898
    m_Key: Oval round two flags
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861899
    m_Key: 'Fly two laps of an oval round the two flags, at one height. Turn the way an aeroplane does: lean into the turn and turn the nose at the same time, so the camera always looks where you are going.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861900
    m_Key: Pass flag 1 on its right
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861901
    m_Key: Pass flag 2 on its left
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861902
    m_Key: Pass flag 3 on its right
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861903
    m_Key: Pass flag 4 on its left
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861904
    m_Key: Pass flag 5 on its right
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861905
    m_Key: Pass flag 6 on its left
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861906
    m_Key: Slalom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861907
    m_Key: 'Six flags in a line. Weave through them: the first on its right, the next on its left, and so on, then land on the far pad. Start each turn early; the drone keeps sliding after you level it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861908
    m_Key: 'Stay low: through gate 1'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861909
    m_Key: 'Stay low: through gate 2'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861910
    m_Key: 'Stay low: through gate 3'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861911
    m_Key: 'Stay low: through gate 4'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861912
    m_Key: Low flight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6782631549861913
    m_Key: 'Fly the whole course between half a metre and a metre and a half above the ground, through four low gates. The ground comes up fast in this view: hold the height with small moves of the throttle and do not chase it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525032333312
    m_Key: Take off and hold the drone inside the box for 20 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247872
    m_Key: Acro hover
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247873
    m_Key: 'Acro mode: the drone no longer levels itself. It stays at whatever angle you leave it, so every lean must be taken out again by hand. Hold it inside the 3 m box for 20 seconds, then land.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247874
    m_Key: Longest stay inside the box
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247875
    m_Key: Make each correction half as big as you think it needs, and take it out at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247876
    m_Key: Lap 1, gate 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247877
    m_Key: Lap 1, gate 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247878
    m_Key: Lap 1, gate 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247879
    m_Key: Lap 1, gate 4
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247880
    m_Key: Lap 2, gate 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247881
    m_Key: Lap 2, gate 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247882
    m_Key: Lap 2, gate 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247883
    m_Key: Lap 2, gate 4
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247884
    m_Key: Acro circuit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247885
    m_Key: 'Four gates in a ring, two laps, in acro mode. Fly the ring to the right: west gate, north gate, east gate, south gate. Keep a steady, easy speed: a clean lap matters more than a fast one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247886
    m_Key: Gate 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247887
    m_Key: Gate 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247888
    m_Key: Gate 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247889
    m_Key: Gate 4
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247890
    m_Key: Gate 5
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247891
    m_Key: Gate 6
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247892
    m_Key: Land on the finish pad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525095247893
    m_Key: 'Racing line: chicane and hairpin'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525099442176
    m_Key: 'Six gates: a chicane, then a hairpin back the way you came. The time decides the stars. Go wide into a turn and close to the inside of it, and look at the gate after the one you are flying through.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525099442177
    m_Key: 'Time: gold 40 s, silver 55 s, bronze 75 s'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525099442178
    m_Key: 'Time is lost in the turns: brake less, and start turning before the gate, not in it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525099442179
    m_Key: 'Proximity: five gaps'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6918525099442180
    m_Key: 'Five openings in a line, each smaller than the one before: from 3 m wide down to 1 m. Fly through the middle of each. Touching a frame hard ends the attempt.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680404140032
    m_Key: 'Height is your safety: start every new move high, and throttle down while the drone is upside down.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220416
    m_Key: Climb to 20 m
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220417
    m_Key: 'Half roll: turn the drone onto its back'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220418
    m_Key: Pull the right stick back until the drone is level again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220419
    m_Key: Fly level, back the way you came
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220420
    m_Key: Split-S
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220421
    m_Key: 'The split-S turns the drone round and trades height for speed. Climb to 20 m and fly forward. Roll onto your back, lower the throttle, then pull the right stick back: the nose drops through straight down and comes up facing the way you came. The move costs height, so never start it low.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220422
    m_Key: Fly through the gate with good speed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220423
    m_Key: Throttle up and pull back until the nose points at the sky
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220424
    m_Key: Go over the top of the gate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220425
    m_Key: Lower the throttle and keep pulling until the drone is level again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220426
    m_Key: Come through the same gate again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220427
    m_Key: Power loop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220428
    m_Key: A power loop goes through a gate, up and over the top of it on its back, and down through the gate again. Come through fast, add throttle and pull back. Over the top, lower the throttle and keep pulling, and look for the gate as the nose comes down. A wide loop is easier than a tight one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220429
    m_Key: Climb to 12 m
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220430
    m_Key: 'Roll: right stick fully to one side until the drone has gone right round'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220431
    m_Key: Level out and climb back to 12 m
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220432
    m_Key: 'Flip: right stick fully forward or back until the drone has gone right over'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220433
    m_Key: Roll and flip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6924680492220434
    m_Key: 'The two moves every freestyle trick is built from. Climb to 12 m. For each move: a short burst of throttle, then lower the throttle, push the right stick fully over and hold it until the horizon comes round again, then centre the stick and catch the drone with the throttle.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6926043406139392
    m_Key: CERTIFICATE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6926043414528000
