      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6926043414528011
    m_Key: The flights were flown in the Ushqyr simulator. This certificate records training; it is not a permit to fly a drone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6926043414528012
    m_Key: Certificate
